{"orgCode":"1750","name":"California Horse Racing Board","agencyCode":"1000","agencyName":"Business and Consumer Services","description":"The California Horse Racing Board regulates parimutuel wagering for the protection of the public and promotes the horse racing and breeding industries.\n\nJurisdiction and supervision over race meets in California where horse races with wagering on their results are held, and over all things having to do with the operation of such race meets, are vested in the seven-member California Horse Racing Board, who are appointed by the Governor. Principal activities of the Board include:\n\n• Protecting the public's interests.\n\n• Enforcing laws, rules, and regulations pertaining to horse racing in California.\n\n• Conducting research to determine the cause and prevention of horse racing accidents and the effects of drug substances on horses, and to detect foreign drug substances.\n\n• Licensing of racing associations and participants in the racing industry.\n\n• Acting as a quasi-judicial body in matters pertaining to horse racing meets.\n\n• Encouraging agriculture and the breeding of horses in the state.\n\n• Collecting the state's lawful share of revenue derived from horse racing meets.\n\n• Tabulating, analyzing, and publishing statistical racing information.","website":"https://www.chrb.ca.gov","totals":{"amounts":{"py":19429,"cy":19927,"by":19888},"positions":{"py":45.2,"cy":49.2,"by":49.2}},"programs":{"id":"exp/1000/1750","kind":"department","name":"California Horse Racing Board","code":"1750","amounts":{"py":19429,"cy":19927,"by":19888},"positions":{"py":45.2,"cy":49.2,"by":49.2},"byFundType":{"general":{"py":0,"cy":0,"by":4000},"special":{"py":19429,"cy":19927,"by":15888}},"children":[{"id":"exp/1000/1750/1610","kind":"program","name":"California Horse Racing Board","code":"1610","amounts":{"py":19429,"cy":19927,"by":19888},"byFundType":{"general":{"py":0,"cy":0,"by":4000},"special":{"py":19429,"cy":19927,"by":15888}},"positio